{"url": "https://revisor.mo.gov/main/OneSection.aspx?section=79.130&bid=3732", "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T20:36:32.357731+00:00", "html": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n\r\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Revised Statutes of Missouri, Missouri laws \" /><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Missouri Laws, Official Missouri Laws, RSMo\" /><meta property=\"og:image:secure_url\" content=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/LRWebIcon.jpg\" /><title>\r\n\tMissouri Revisor of Statutes - Revised Statutes of Missouri,  RSMo Section 79.130\r\n</title>\r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, nofollow\" /> \r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/favicon-64x64.jpg\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/main/OneSection.aspx?section=79.130&amp;bid=3732\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"79.130\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ordinances \u2014 procedure to enact \u2014 inapplicable, when.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/LRWebIcon.ico\" /><link rel=\"icon\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/favicon_package_v0.16/favicon.ico\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/favicon_package_v0.16/apple-touch-icon.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/favicon_package_v0.16/favicon-32x32.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"https://revisor.mo.gov/MOPics/favicon_package_v0.16/favicon-16x16.png\" />\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html {\r\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .lr-body {\r\n        